[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0541","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0541.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0690","title":"CGI Script Center Auction Weaver 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"CGI Script Center Auction Weaver 1.0.2 及更早版本的 CGI 脚本存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 fromfile 参数传递包含 shell 元字符的特制请求，利用 Web 服务器权限执行任意系统命令。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击者可直接获取服务器控制权，危害严重。受影响版本为 Auction Weaver 1.0.2 及之前版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0690"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 Auction Weaver CGI 脚本至 1.03 或更高版本（如厂商已发布修复版本）；若无法升级，立即从 Web 服务器移除 auctionweaver.cgi 或禁用该 CGI 脚本。作为临时缓解措施，在 Web 服务器层过滤 fromfile 参数中的 shell 元字符（如 ; | & ` $），或启用 Perl 的 taint 模式（-T 参数）并严格校验用户输入。由于该软件已停止维护，建议迁移至其他仍在维护的拍卖系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0370.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0452.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20194"],"poc_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20194"],"exp_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20194"],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0541.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0541.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0541.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0530","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0530.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0676","title":"Netscape Communicator 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Netscape Communicator 及 Navigator 4.04 至 4.74 版本存在 URL 协议处理安全漏洞（又称 Brown Orifice）。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页，触发内嵌 Java 小程序使用 file、http、https、ftp 等协议建立连接，从而绕过浏览器安全限制读取目标系统上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Windows、Mac、Linux 等多个平台的 Netscape 浏览器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0676"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 Netscape Communicator 至 4.75 或更高版本，该版本已修复 Java applet 通过 file/http/https/ftp 协议读取本地文件的漏洞。如无法升级，请在浏览器安全设置中禁用 Java applet 支持，或使用现代浏览器替代。Linux 发行版用户可参考 RedHat (RHSA-2000-054)、Caldera (CSSA-2000-027)、SuSE 及 FreeBSD (FreeBSD-SA-00:39) 发布的安全公告安装对应补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0019.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0115.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0236.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0265.html","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-027.1.txt","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-15.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_60.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-054.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1546","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20140","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0676.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0676","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0676.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0676.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-whp4-v3p7-5mch/GHSA-whp4-v3p7-5mch.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0676.json","https://github.com/cpu0/gutenberg/blob/2338b2e24640a2d6553326ff5f05a6b6bc079348/DTIC_ADA453231/DTIC_ADA453231_djvu.txt","ftp://ftp.FreeBSD.org/pub/FreeBSD/CERT/advisories/FreeBSD-SA-00:39.netscape.asc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0530.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0530.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0530.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0943","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0943.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1214","title":"iputils ping 缓冲区溢出本地权限提升漏洞","description":"iputils 工具包中的 ping 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，漏洞位于 outpack 或 buf 变量中。本地攻击者可通过向 ping 程序发送特制的网络数据包触发缓冲区溢出，导致内存数据被破坏，从而获取目标系统的 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 6.2 至 7J 及其他使用 iputils 20001010 之前版本的操作系统，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，无需用户交互即可完成利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1214"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-10-18T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:23.813","remediation":"升级 iputils 至 20001010 或更高版本。Red Hat Linux 用户可通过官方渠道更新 iputils 软件包，或从 https://www.skbuff.net/iputils/ 获取源码编译安装。如无法升级，可通过移除 ping 的 SUID 位（chmod u-s /bin/ping）限制本地非授权用户执行 ping 来缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0429.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97208562830613&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97249980727834&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/5431.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-087.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1813","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1214.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1214","https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc/blob/b6e12b4b616699c4d3fe460040a833caca2c1858/upstream-layers/openembedded-core/meta/recipes-extended/iputils/iputils_20250605.bb","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-1214.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1214.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a63d131cc61df62c077c7700617ad6343ec52ef/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jpwg-qx54-r8vg/GHSA-jpwg-qx54-r8vg.json","https://github.com/AMDESE/OpenBMC/blob/a93c7dc5b57f2f63469116ef025ed1bfebd776b0/poky/meta/recipes-extended/iputils/iputils_s20200821.bb","https://github.com/openembedded/openembedded-core/blob/496ab6151ead169d9f4873d1e2a3f5e646c73b07/meta/recipes-extended/iputils/iputils_20250605.bb","https://github.com/ArmSoM/rk3506-rkr4.2-sdk/blob/7066d7b709d07fe21dc1808017ba11cc9987cfcf/yocto/poky/meta/recipes-extended/iputils/iputils_20240117.bb","https://github.com/lgirdk/poky/blob/a7331c399252c8b365e51290c8eba3d2f6aa6fa1/meta/recipes-extended/iputils/iputils_20240905.bb"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0943.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0942","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0942.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1213","title":"Red Hat Linux iputils ping 未释放特权漏洞","description":"iputils 中的 ping 工具在获取原始套接字后未正确放弃 root 特权，导致即使后续代码存在缺陷，攻击者也可利用这些缺陷以高权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 6.2 至 7J 及其他使用 iputils 20001010 之前版本的操作系统。本地攻击者可通过向存在缺陷的 ping 程序发送特制请求触发漏洞，实现权限提升，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1213"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-10-18T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:23.697","remediation":"升级 iputils 至 20001010 或更高版本，该版本在获取原始套接字后正确释放特权。对于 Red Hat Linux 6.2 至 7J 系统，通过 `rpm -Uvh iputils-20001010-*.rpm` 安装更新包；其他发行版使用对应包管理器更新。如无法升级，移除 ping 的 SUID 位（`chmod u-s /bin/ping`）以降低提权风险，但会限制普通用户使用 ping 功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0429.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97249980727834&w=2","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-087.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1213.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1213","https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc/blob/b6e12b4b616699c4d3fe460040a833caca2c1858/upstream-layers/openembedded-core/meta/recipes-extended/iputils/iputils_20250605.bb","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-1213.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1213.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8aaa5e66bb6b412c1d97714c08a2d07173ae8425/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gvg8-m7rh-qfg2/GHSA-gvg8-m7rh-qfg2.json","https://github.com/opencomputeproject/OCP-HM-MegaRAC_Community_Edition/blob/a7584dca1fb709e557b9393ecfcaa2df00e00788/poky/meta/recipes-extended/iputils/iputils_20211215.bb","https://github.com/AMDESE/OpenBMC/blob/a93c7dc5b57f2f63469116ef025ed1bfebd776b0/poky/meta/recipes-extended/iputils/iputils_s20200821.bb","https://github.com/mozcelikors/rpi5_yocto_udemy/blob/51de85b177ca45bb5f567cf7047ae0c7809e3cbc/poky/meta/recipes-extended/iputils/iputils_20240117.bb","https://github.com/openeuler-mirror/yocto-meta-openeuler/blob/68a80f21cf463fb791c3d8fcb5f347b640018f22/meta-openeuler/recipes-extended/iputils/iputils_20221126.bb"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0942.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0603","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0603.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0816","title":"RedHat Tmpwatch 任意命令执行漏洞","description":"RedHat 6.2/7.0 版本中 tmpwatch 工具的 --fuser 选项存在命令注入漏洞，由于对文件名中的 Shell 元字符（如反引号、分号、管道符等）缺乏过滤和转义，本地攻击者可通过创建包含恶意 Shell 元字符的文件名，诱使 tmpwatch 在执行 --fuser 选项处理临时文件清理时触发命令注入，从而以 tmpwatch 进程权限（通常为 root 权限）执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 RedHat Linux 6.2 和 7.0 版本，攻击条件为本地用户具备创建文件权限，CVSS 2.1 评分（本地攻击、低复杂度、部分完整性影响），属于本地权限提升漏洞，RedHat 已发布补丁修复（MDKSA-2000-056）。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0816"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-06T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:32.177","remediation":"建议升级 tmpwatch 到 2.8.4 或更高版本（RedHat 6.2 升级至 tmpwatch-2.8.4-2，RedHat 7.0 升级至 tmpwatch-2.8.4-3）。若无法立即升级，可编辑 /etc/cron.daily/tmpwatch 移除 --fuser 参数，或使用 chattr +i 锁定 /tmp 防止创建包含 shell 元字符的文件名作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-056.php3?dis=7.1","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-080.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1785","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise64.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5320","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20285","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0816.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0816","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0816.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0816.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pv6p-xwqp-cf4x/GHSA-pv6p-xwqp-cf4x.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2000-056.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0816.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--72055458-6752-4273-99ad-933cb35b6c32.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--72055458-6752-4273-99ad-933cb35b6c32.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0603.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0603.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0603.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0936","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0936.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1207","title":"Red Hat Linux usermode userhelper 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 的 usermode 包中的 userhelper 工具在执行非 setuid 程序时以 root 权限运行，导致 glibc 的安全防护机制（如格式化字符串保护）未被激活。本地攻击者可通过设置 LANG 或 LC_ALL 环境变量触发 glibc 中的格式化字符串漏洞（CVE-2000-0844），从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，但无需认证即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1207"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-09-30T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:22.973","remediation":"立即升级 usermode 软件包至 1.74 或更高版本（Red Hat 已通过 RHSA-2000:016 安全公告修复）。可通过 `rpm -Uvh usermode-1.74-1.i386.rpm` 命令安装更新版本。如无法升级，可移除 userhelper 的 setuid 位（`chmod u-s /usr/sbin/userhelper`）作为临时缓解措施，但会导致部分用户管理功能不可用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97034397026473&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97063854808796&w=2","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2000/MDKSA-2000-059.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-075.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-1207.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1207.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1207","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/f8240b6ddc6552565afc6758802e9608cfaff873/data/2000/CVE-2000-1207.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1207.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ece131eb82ceb38a160571408bcbbb92bfa0f3c0/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vcxc-2pg3-26ww/GHSA-vcxc-2pg3-26ww.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1207.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8e62b392-ad37-4607-9659-cd46a735cb20.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--8e62b392-ad37-4607-9659-cd46a735cb20.owl","https://github.com/aroario2003/cram/blob/8b6397e40d53ab4226f6bbf21a02de41eac8ee8e/db/CVE_List_SUE2_Patch2.sql"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0936.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0363","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0363.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0354","title":"Linux Mirror 目录遍历文件创建漏洞","description":"Linux 系统下的 mirror 2.8.x 版本存在路径遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的文件名或目录名，利用 mirror 工具在处理镜像下载时未对目标路径进行充分校验的缺陷，将文件写入到本地目标目录的上一级目录中，实现目录跳转。该漏洞可导致攻击者在目标系统上任意位置创建文件，进而可能结合其他漏洞实现权限提升或执行恶意代码。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程触发，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0354"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-09-28T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:32.570","remediation":"升级 mirror 至 2.9 或更高版本（2.9 已修复目录遍历问题）。Debian 用户可通过 apt-get install mirror 更新；如不再需要 mirror 功能，建议迁移至 wget 或 rsync 替代。若无法升级，可在 mirror 配置中限制目标目录权限，确保运行 mirror 的用户无上级目录写入权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/1999/19991018","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_22.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/681","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=15769.990928%40tomcat.ru","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0354.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0354","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0354.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0354.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-353f-x9x4-qj59/GHSA-353f-x9x4-qj59.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0354.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a91f0728-670a-4dba-83d8-8ecbd61b2f53.json","https://github.com/l/debian-webwml/blob/80cd9461d384c50e61f7c585e566ce9d00c113fc/webwml/english/security/1999/19991018.data"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0363.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0444","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0444.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0545","title":"BSD mailx 8.1.1-10 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"BSD mailx 8.1.1-10 邮件命令在 Linux 系统中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地用户可通过向 mailx 命令传递过长的 -c（抄送）参数触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致栈溢出覆盖返回地址，从而实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响运行 BSD mailx 8.1.1-10 版本的 Linux 系统（如 Slackware 等 BSD 衍生发行版），攻击者需具备本地登录权限，通过构造超长的 -c 参数字符串触发缓冲区溢出，覆盖返回地址执行任意 Shellcode，最终获得提升后的权限（通常为 root 或 mail 组权限）。CVSS 评分 4.6（本地/低复杂度/无需认证/部分机密性/完整性/可用性影响）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0545"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-08-08T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:58.010","remediation":"建议升级 mailx 至 8.1.2 或更高版本（如 mailx 12.4+），或切换至 heirloom-mailx / bsd-mailx 维护分支。若无法升级，可通过编译选项禁用 -c 参数（编译时定义 NO_CC），或在 /etc/mail.rc 中设置 askcc=off 禁用碳复制功能作为临时缓解；同时限制普通用户对 mail 命令的执行权限（chmod 750 /usr/bin/mail），仅允许 mail 组用户执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0435.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000605","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1305","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19992","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6871b34457c95f7cba228f12a5ad62036a72e749/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0545.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0545","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0545.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0545.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6j7v-q8xr-8rhx/GHSA-6j7v-q8xr-8rhx.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0545.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0545.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--26346ae8-65cf-4670-82bf-4f2a400b6083.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0444.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0247","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0247.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0278","title":"SalesLogix Corporation eViewer 1.0 slxweb.dll 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"SalesLogix eViewer 1.0 的 slxweb.dll 管理程序存在认证缺失漏洞。远程攻击者无需任何身份验证，直接访问 slxweb.dll 管理页面即可触发该漏洞，导致目标系统服务崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 SalesLogix eViewer 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。厂商未发布官方补丁，建议限制对该管理页面的网络访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0278"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-08-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:22.993","remediation":"建议升级 SalesLogix eViewer 至最新版本（如有），或迁移至受支持的替代产品。如无法升级，可在 IIS 中将 slxweb.dll 管理路径限制为仅允许受信 IP 段访问，移除匿名访问权限，必要时直接删除或重命名 slxweb.dll 文件以彻底阻断攻击路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/current/0006.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1089","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19835","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0278.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0278","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0278.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0278.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9v3f-j9v9-gvh5/GHSA-9v3f-j9v9-gvh5.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/eviewer.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0278.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0247.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0247.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0247.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0817","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0817.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0667","title":"Caldera Linux gpm 本地文件删除与拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Caldera Linux 系统中所集成的通用鼠标服务（gpm）存在安全漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向该服务发送特制请求利用此漏洞，从而删除系统任意文件或触发拒绝服务（DoS）条件。该漏洞影响 Caldera Linux 发行版，利用前提是攻击者已获得本地系统访问权限。CVSS 评分为 3.6，危害等级较低。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0667"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-27","updated":"2000-07-27","remediation":"将 gpm 软件包升级到 Caldera 官方已修复的版本，或应用相应安全补丁。如系统不需要鼠标控制台功能，建议通过系统启动项配置禁用以减少攻击面。管理有本地访问权限的用户列表，避免赋予不可信用户 shell 访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0273.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1512","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2000-0667"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0817.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0526","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0526.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0673","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0/2000 NetBIOS Name Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 及 Windows 2000 系统的 NetBIOS 名称服务器（NBNS）协议未对通信数据包进行身份认证，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送伪造的 Name Conflict（名称冲突）或 Name Release（名称释放）数据报，导致目标系统 NetBIOS 名称服务崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 及 Windows 2000 系统，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。攻击者无需认证即可在局域网内实施攻击，利用门槛较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0673"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-27","updated":"2000-07-27","remediation":"安装微软 MS00-047 安全补丁（Windows 2000 补丁 KB269239，Windows NT 4.0 补丁见微软公告）；在注册表 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\NetBT\\Parameters 下设置 NoNameReleaseOnDemand=1 拒绝名称释放请求；在防火墙阻断 UDP 137-138 和 TCP 139 端口外部访问；Windows 2000 中可使用 IPSec 策略对 137-139 端口通信进行身份认证，防止 NBNS 欺骗攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-047","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5035","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20106","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1514","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1515","http://www.nai.com/research/covert/advisories/044.asp"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0526.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0521","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0521.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0668","title":"Linux pam_console 认证绕过漏洞","description":"Linux 系统 pam_console PAM 模块存在认证绕过漏洞，当 gdm 或 kdm 等显示管理器启用 XDMCP 协议时，未经授权的用户可通过控制台访问系统并重启机器，导致系统可用性受损。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0668"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-27","updated":"2000-07-27","remediation":"应用 RedHat 安全公告 RHSA-2000-044 提供的补丁，或禁用 gdm/kdm 的 XDMCP 功能以防止未授权控制台访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0398.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0455.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-044.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1513","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5001"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0521.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0778","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0778.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0637","title":"Microsoft Excel 97/2000 Register.ID 函数任意代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Excel 97 及 2000 版本中存在代码执行漏洞，攻击者可利用 Register.ID 函数指定恶意的 .dll 文件，从而在用户打开特制 Excel 文件时执行任意命令。该漏洞源于 Excel 对 Register.ID 函数参数缺乏充分校验，允许加载外部动态链接库。攻击者需诱使用户打开包含恶意构造的 Excel 文档以触发漏洞。CVSS 评分 4.6，影响 Excel 97 及 2000 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0637"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-26T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:09.710","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-051 提供的补丁：Excel 2000 用户安装 KB269252 更新，Excel 97 用户安装 KB269263 更新，该补丁禁用 REGISTER.ID 函数对任意 DLL 的调用。由于 Excel 97/2000 已停止支持，建议升级至受支持的 Microsoft Office 版本（如 Office 2016/2019/365）以获取持续安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1451","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=396B3F8F.9244D290%40nat.bg","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-051","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5016","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4382b0b8593e7ef30616ab300314afbbf1571636/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0637.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0637","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0637.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cae595683b6fe65324ec717750e7cdca928c1db7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0637.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29756569ae7c866e39492d6faf2dcdff310590f7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-977m-wr29-gj29/GHSA-977m-wr29-gj29.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0637.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3d6c4749-af28-4ca8-a71d-d396d56b559a.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3563ce5ac8824b98ec39d3c626e2f6617054b9f7/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--3d6c4749-af28-4ca8-a71d-d396d56b559a.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0778.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0515","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0515.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0664","title":"AnalogX SimpleServer:WWW 1.0.6 目录遍历漏洞","description":"AnalogX SimpleServer:WWW 1.06 及更早版本存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标 Web 服务器发送经 %2E URL 编码绕过过滤机制的特制请求（如将\"..\"编码为\"%2E%2E\"），即可遍历服务器文件系统，读取任意文件内容。该漏洞利用难度低，影响范围广，可导致敏感信息泄露。厂商至今未发布官方补丁，建议用户升级或更换其他 Web 服务器软件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0664"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-26T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:13.153","remediation":"升级 AnalogX SimpleServer:WWW 至 1.07 及以上版本，该版本已修复 %2E 编码的目录遍历问题。若厂商已停止维护，建议迁移至 Apache httpd、Nginx 等仍在积极维护的 Web 服务器，并在迁移前在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）侧配置规则拦截包含 `%2E%2E%2F` 或 `../` 的 URL 请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0374.html","http://www.analogx.com/contents/download/network/sswww.htm","http://www.osvdb.org/388","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1508","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4999","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20103","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/47aadecb5d7f9b0723652503f764f5addc1275b9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0664.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0664","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0664.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4dd512046a74ddd9ae16741caf0933056ffd666e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0664.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bbc8c0a71659f005292a66be54d5a75a1b892d59/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pgpv-rcv8-q82m/GHSA-pgpv-rcv8-q82m.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1586.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/analogx_traversal.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--90694115-a3a6-4087-8725-e35e9a08c1aa.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0515.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0807","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0807.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0663","title":"Microsoft Windows NT/2000 相对路径本地代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows NT 和 Windows 2000 系统的 Shell 可执行文件 (Explorer.exe) 注册表项使用了相对路径名，本地攻击者可通过在 %Systemdrive% 目录下放置名为 Explorer.exe 的恶意木马文件，利用系统启动或调用 Shell 时优先搜索当前目录的特性，以当前用户权限执行任意代码，即\"相对 Shell 路径\"漏洞。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 及 Windows 2000 系统，需本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 4.6。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0663"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-07-25T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:13.030","remediation":"立即安装微软 MS00-052 安全公告对应补丁（KB269049）：Windows NT 4.0 用户下载 Workstation/Server/Enterprise Edition 补丁，Terminal Server Edition 用户下载对应补丁；Windows 2000 用户下载 Professional/Server/Advanced Server 补丁。如无法安装补丁，临时缓解措施为：修改 %SystemDrive%\\ 根目录（通常为 C:\\）的 NTFS 权限，移除 Users 组的写入权限，仅保留 Administrators 和 SYSTEM 的写入权限，防止普通用户放置木马版本的 Explorer.exe。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.microsoft.com/technet/support/kb.asp?ID=269049","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1507","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-052","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5040","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/47aadecb5d7f9b0723652503f764f5addc1275b9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0663.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0663","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0663.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4dd512046a74ddd9ae16741caf0933056ffd666e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0663.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/smb_nt_ms00-052.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bbc8c0a71659f005292a66be54d5a75a1b892d59/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-527c-22g3-c82g/GHSA-527c-22g3-c82g.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0663.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/smb_nt_ms00-052.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0807.toml"}]